@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant UAC
participant Proxy
participant UAS

UAC -> Proxy: INVITE\nSupported: 100rel
Proxy -> UAS: INVITE
UAS --> Proxy: 183 Session Progress\nRequire: 100rel\nRSeq: N
Proxy --> UAC: 183 Session Progress\nRequire: 100rel\nRSeq: N
UAS --> Proxy: retransmit 183\n(T1, 2T1, 4T1, ...)
Proxy --> UAC: retransmit 183
UAC -> Proxy: PRACK\nRAck: N CSeq INVITE
Proxy -> UAS: PRACK
UAS --> Proxy: 200 OK (PRACK)
Proxy --> UAC: 200 OK (PRACK)
UAS --> UAC: 200 OK (INVITE)\n(after required PRACKs)

note over UAC,UAS
PRACK acknowledges one reliable 1xx response;
it is a normal in-dialog SIP request with its own response.
end note
@enduml
